summary:
  The deferred teardown of a lapsed order runs even after the order was given again.

history:
  A wake-up alarm firing in the same turn as the first heartbeat tick after a
  night raises the order; the teardown then silenced the alarm.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          Qt.callLater(function() { if (!root._wantsPlaying) stopWithFade(); });

replace:
          Qt.callLater(function() { if (true) stopWithFade(); });

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_order_lapsing_is_torn_down_like_a_stop.
  Line-neutral.
